# Feature modules — VESTRA (feature-first Clean Architecture)
#
# Each feature follows a layered structure:
#   <feature>/
#     presentation/    UI: screens, widgets, controllers (Riverpod)
#     application/     Use cases / application services
#     domain/          Entities, value objects, repository interfaces
#     infrastructure/  Repository implementations, data sources, DTOs
#
# Planned features (per PRD):
#   authentication, onboarding, dashboard, wardrobe, camera, ai,
#   recommendations, history, statistics, notifications, profile,
#   settings, premium
